	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"&bPowah&r is a comprehensive &6energy generation&r mod that provides players with a wide range of &dpower generation and storage systems&r, enabling efficient and scalable energy management in Minecraft."
				""
				"&3能源&r可以从各种&e可再生及不可再生能源&r中产生，包括&a太阳能电池板&r、&b热电发电机&r、&c熔炉发电机&r和&5反应堆&r。所有&c能源设备&r均可连接成一个&d互联电网&r，让玩家能通过统一的&9界面&r来&a管理多个机器和系统的&r电力分配&9。"
				""
				"&bPowah&r offers different tiers of &6energy cells&r and &6energy cables&r to store and transport energy efficiently. The mod's advanced features, like &eWireless Energy Transmission&r, further enhance its usability and integration with other tech mods, making it a vital addition to any technologically advanced Minecraft modpack."
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "ftbquests:custom_icon"
				tag: {
					Icon: "kubejs:textures/gui/mark.png"
				}
